<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/baredsc> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "baredSC (Bayesian Approach to Retreive Expression Distribution of Single Cell) is a tool that uses a Monte-Carlo Markov Chain to estimate a confidence interval on the probability density function (PDF) of expression of one or two genes from single-cell RNA-seq data." ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
