        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-paralleldist>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-parallelly>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-proxy>,
