<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-deeptarget> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Deep characterization of cancer drugs" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "This package predicts a drug’s primary target(s) or secondary target(s) by integrating large-scale genetic and drug screens from the Cancer Dependency Map project run by the Broad Institute. It further investigates whether the drug specifically targets the wild-type or mutated target forms. To show how to use this package in practice, we provided sample data along with step-by-step example." ;
