    ns1:description "DNAZooData is a data package giving programmatic access to genome assemblies and Hi-C contact matrices uniformly processed by the [DNA Zoo Consortium](https://www.dnazoo.org/). The matrices are available in the multi-resolution `.hic` format. A URL to corrected genome assemblies in `.fastq` format is also provided to the end-user." ;
    ns1:downloadUrl <https://bioarchive.galaxyproject.org/DNAZooData_1.10.0.tar.gz>,
        <https://bioconductor.org/packages/3.22/bioc/src/contrib/Archive/DNAZooData/DNAZooData_1.10.0.tar.gz>,
