    ns1:softwareRequirements <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-biobase>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-biocfilecache>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-complexheatmap>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-s4vectors>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-summarizedexperiment>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-base>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-dplyr>,
