        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-matrix>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-purrr>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-reshape>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-rlang>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-strawr>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-stringr>,
