        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-networkd3>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-pheatmap>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-purrr>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-reshape2>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-rlist>,
