<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-metaboannotation> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Utilities for Annotation of Metabolomics Data" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "High level functions to assist in annotation of (metabolomics) data sets. These include functions to perform simple tentative annotations based on mass matching but also functions to consider m/z and retention times for annotation of LC-MS features given that respective reference values are available. In addition, the function provides high-level functions to simplify matching of LC-MS/MS spectra against spectral libraries and objects and functionality to represent and manage such matched data." ;
