        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-singlecellexperiment>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-summarizedexperiment>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-base>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-car>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-matrix>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-mcmcpack>,
