<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-netactivity> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Compute gene set scores from a deep learning framework" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "#' NetActivity enables to compute gene set scores from previously trained sparsely-connected autoencoders. The package contains a function to prepare the data (`prepareSummarizedExperiment`) and a function to compute the gene set scores (`computeGeneSetScores`). The package `NetActivityData` contains different pre-trained models to be directly applied to the data. Alternatively, the users might use the package to compute gene set scores using custom models." ;
