<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-panomir> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Detection of miRNAs that regulate interacting groups of pathways" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "PanomiR is a package to detect miRNAs that target groups of pathways from gene expression data. This package provides functionality for generating pathway activity profiles, determining differentially activated pathways between user-specified conditions, determining clusters of pathways via the PCxN package, and generating miRNAs targeting clusters of pathways. These function can be used separately or sequentially to analyze RNA-Seq data." ;
