        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-ggrepel>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-htmlwidgets>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-igraph>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-plotly>,
