        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-rstan>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-rstantools>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-stanheaders>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-tibble>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-tidybayes>,
