        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-cluster>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-dbscan>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-dosnow>,
