<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-scider> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Spatial cell-type inter-correlation by density in R" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "scider is an user-friendly R package providing functions to model the global density of cells in a slide of spatial transcriptomics data. All functions in the package are built based on the SpatialExperiment object, allowing integration into various spatial transcriptomics-related packages from Bioconductor. After modelling density, the package allows for serveral downstream analysis, including colocalization analysis, boundary detection analysis and differential density analysis." ;
