<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-simbu> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Simulate Bulk RNA-seq Datasets from Single-Cell Datasets" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "SimBu can be used to simulate bulk RNA-seq datasets with known cell type fractions. You can either use your own single-cell study for the simulation or the sfaira database. Different pre-defined simulation scenarios exist, as are options to run custom simulations. Additionally, expression values can be adapted by adding an mRNA bias, which produces more biologically relevant simulations." ;
