    ns1:description "Ion Trap positive ionization mode data in mzML file format.  Subset from 500-850 m/z and 1190-1310 seconds, incl. MS2 and MS3, intensity threshold 100.000. Extracts from FTICR Apex III, m/z 400-450.  Subset of UPLC - Bruker micrOTOFq data, both mzML and mz5. LC-MSMS and MRM files from proteomics experiments. PSI mzIdentML example files for various search engines." ;
