<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-scistreer> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Fast maximum-likelihood phylogeny inference from noisy single-cell data using the 'ScisTree' algorithm by Yufeng Wu (2019) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btz676>. 'scistreer' provides an 'R' interface and improves speed via 'Rcpp' and 'RcppParallel', making the method applicable to massive single-cell datasets (>10,000 cells)." ;
