<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-enrichmentbrowser> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Seamless navigation through combined results of set-based and network-based enrichment analysis" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "The EnrichmentBrowser package implements essential functionality for the enrichment analysis of gene expression data. The analysis combines the advantages of set-based and network-based enrichment analysis in order to derive high-confidence gene sets and biological pathways that are differentially regulated in the expression data under investigation. Besides, the package facilitates the visualization and exploration of such sets and pathways." ;
