<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-pharmacogx> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Analysis of Large-Scale Pharmacogenomic Data" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "Contains a set of functions to perform large-scale analysis of pharmaco-genomic data. These include the PharmacoSet object for storing the results of pharmacogenomic experiments, as well as a number of functions for computing common summaries of drug-dose response and correlating them with the molecular features in a cancer cell-line." ;
