<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-scrapper> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Bindings to C++ Libraries for Single-Cell Analysis" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "Implements R bindings to C++ code for analyzing single-cell (expression) data, mostly from various libscran libraries. Each function performs an individual step in the single-cell analysis workflow, ranging from quality control to clustering and marker detection. It is mostly intended for other Bioconductor package developers to build more user-friendly end-to-end workflows." ;
