<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-smartsva> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Introduces a fast and efficient Surrogate Variable Analysis algorithm that captures variation of unknown sources (batch effects) for high-dimensional data sets. The algorithm is built on the 'irwsva.build' function of the 'sva' package and proposes a revision on it that achieves an order of magnitude faster running time while trading no accuracy loss in return." ;
