        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-base>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-bench>,
        <https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/r-checkmate>,
