<https://github.com/bioconda/bioconda-recipes/tree/master/recipes/bioconductor-universalmotif> a ns1:SoftwareApplication ;
    ns1:alternateName "Import, Modify, and Export Motifs with R" ;
    ns1:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalTool/1.0-RELEASE> ;
    ns1:description "Allows for importing most common motif types into R for use by functions provided by other Bioconductor motif-related packages. Motifs can be exported into most major motif formats from various classes as defined by other Bioconductor packages. A suite of motif and sequence manipulation and analysis functions are included, including enrichment, comparison, P-value calculation, shuffling, trimming, higher-order motifs, and others." ;
